{"id":"5bb464e17c37a257b8ec9f4e80d55c3d2163ea2a","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/023/697.htm","title":"（更新：已恢复）DeepSeek 网页 / API 服务突发部分中断，提示“服务器暂时不可用”","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：浩渺","excerpt":"据网友反馈，DeepSeek 今日突发服务异常，对话时提示“服务器暂时不可用”。其官方状态页显示网页与 API 服务均出现部分中断，#DeepSeek# 官方正在排查问题","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            <div><p>感谢IT之家网友 <a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2026879\" rel=\"nofollow\">九闲</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2014192\" rel=\"nofollow\">崇囧崇</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D896839\" rel=\"nofollow\">八重神子</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2058414\" rel=\"nofollow\">熊猫virtual</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2332397\" rel=\"nofollow\">素以为绚兮</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D1846800\" rel=\"nofollow\">Domado</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2658846\" rel=\"nofollow\">核平鸽</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2475131\" rel=\"nofollow\">惊讶仙人</a>、<a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2351425\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alan_Plex</a> 的线索投递！</p></div>\r\n            <p data-vmark=\"2c23\"><strong>16:48 更新：</strong><strong>已恢复正常</strong></p><p data-vmark=\"7268\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 11 月 7 日消息，据多位IT之家网友反馈，DeepSeek 今日突发出现服务问题，对话提示“服务器暂时不可用”。</p><p data-vmark=\"14d9\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/ad5211ab-04f2-460a-9189-6c0c3fa88b8c.jpg\" w=\"1236\" h=\"2399\" data-mpos=\"2,0\" data-vmark=\"ed52\" title=\"（更新：已恢复）DeepSeek 网页 / API 服务突发部分中断，提示“服务器暂时不可用”\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/ad5211ab-04f2-460a-9189-6c0c3fa88b8c.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/ad5211ab-04f2-460a-9189-6c0c3fa88b8c.jpg\" width=\"1236\" height=\"1592\"></p><p data-vmark=\"7241\">此外，DeepSeek 官方服务状态页面显示，DeepSeek 网页 / API 服务出现部分中断，官方正在排查问题，目前已中断超 3 分钟。</p>\r\n        </div></DIV>","content_text":"感谢IT之家网友 九闲、崇囧崇、八重神子、熊猫virtual、素以为绚兮、Domado、核平鸽、惊讶仙人、Alan_Plex 的线索投递！ 16:48 更新：已恢复正常IT之家 11 月 7 日消息，据多位IT之家网友反馈，DeepSeek 今日突发出现服务问题，对话提示“服务器暂时不可用”。此外，DeepSeek 官方服务状态页面显示，DeepSeek 网页 / API 服务出现部分中断，官方正在排查问题，目前已中断超 3 分钟。","fetched_at":"2026-11-07T11:46:04.575Z","ok":true}